### Create Product 1 - Laptop Pro
POST http://localhost:8081/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Laptop Pro",
  "description": "16GB RAM, 512GB SSD",
  "price": 1299.99,
  "stock": 15
}

